OL,3,GNEWSANew kit could aid poisoned
OL,4,Awildlife, charity says
OL,5,
OL,6,FWild animals exposed to rat poison
OL,7,Fcould be treated faster and more
OL,8,Faccurately under plans by a wildlife
OL,9,Fcharity to buy new testing equipment.
OL,11,FThe Wildlife Aid Foundation says it is
OL,12,Fclose to raising the #10,500 needed to
OL,13,Fbuy two machines after a fundraising
OL,14,Fappeal attracted almost #10,000 in 48
OL,15,Fhours.
OL,17,FThe Leatherhead-based charity says the
OL,18,Fequipment will provide quicker
OL,19,Fdiagnostic results, helping vets make
OL,20,Fdecisions about treatment while animals
OL,21,Fare still on the operating table.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
